        "created_at": "2014-08-05T21:18:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"ersatz_tom\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/bc8723/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ersatz_tom:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Paul wrote:</b><br><blockquote>While we have absolutely no actual plans to this effect, it is an ambition of mine to have a future Sentinels event somewhere on the island of Great Britain.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;Is there an active Sentinel's Community over in Merry Ol' England?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Eh, not really. At least, no one you want to spend any time with.&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiling_imp.png?v=12\" title=\":smiling_imp:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiling_imp:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
