        "created_at": "2014-08-05T21:26:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"imprimis5\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/imprimis5/48/2387_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> imprimis5:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>ersatz_tom wrote:</b><br><blockquote>&nbsp;Paul wrote:<br><blockquote>While we have absolutely no actual plans to this effect, it is an ambition of mine to have a future Sentinels event somewhere on the island of Great Britain.&nbsp;</blockquote>\n&nbsp;Is there an active Sentinel's Community over in Merry Ol' England?\n</blockquote></div>\nEh, not really. At least, no one you want to spend any time with.&nbsp; :smiling_imp: <span>\n</span></blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p><span>I agree.</span></p>\n<p><span>But yeah, there's a fair few of us forumites over here at least. And there must be a good number of other players judging by the fact that pretty much everything Sentinels-related was sold out throughout the whole country before Christmas…</span></p>",
